Bharata returns kingdom with similes and Rāma consents --- Barbers bathe groom Rāma kin and women dress Sītā --- Sumantra yokes sun chariot and ministers plan auspicious anointing --- Rāma enters city fanned by brothers Sugrīva Vibhīṣaṇa amid gods praise --- Vānaras ride elephants amid drums past flags as citizens greet Rāma friendship --- Rāma greets mothers houses Sugrīva and orders consecration waters --- Vānaras fetch ocean river waters in jars for priest --- Vasiṣṭha priests gods anoint Rāma Sītā amid song garlands gifts --- Rāma rewards brahmins vānaras Sītā honors Hanumān with necklace --- Lakṣmaṇa refuses Bharata anointed Rāma sacrifices rules golden age